WEBVTT

00:12:59.567 --> 00:13:01.798
2000 godina kasnije, drugi filozof,

00:13:01.798 --> 00:13:05.255
Ludwig Wittgenstein, sročio je to ovako:

00:13:05.255 --> 00:13:08.199
"Smrt nije događaj u životu:

00:13:08.199 --> 00:13:11.841
ne živimo toliko da iskusimo smrt.

00:13:11.841 --> 00:13:13.035
Stoga,

00:13:13.035 --> 00:13:15.970
u tom smislu, život nema kraja."

00:13:15.970 --> 00:13:19.146
Tako je meni kao djetetu bilo prirodno

00:13:19.146 --> 00:13:21.513
bojati se da će me progutati praznina,

00:13:21.513 --> 00:13:23.392
no nije bilo racionalno,

00:13:23.392 --> 00:13:25.377
jer takvo što

00:13:25.377 --> 00:13:27.455
nitko od nas neće

00:13:27.455 --> 00:13:30.725
nikad doživjeti.